MTc0NjQ4Nzc1/NS03NjYxLmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Larissa de Macedo Machado (born March 30, 1993), known by her stage name Anitta is a Brazilian singer, songwriter, actress, dancer and record producer. Anitta is managed by John Shahidi of Shots Studios, a US based company backed by Justin Bieber. Anitta began singing at age 8 in a choir from a Catholic church in the Honório Gurgel neighborhood in Rio de Janeiro. At the age of 16, she attended a technical school and was called to work at Vale. In 2010, after posting a video on YouTube, Renato Azevedo (Batutinha DJ), then producer of the independent record company Furacão 2000, called her to sign a contract with the label. Due to the success of the song \"Meiga e Abusada\" in 2012, she signed a contract with Warner Music Brasil the following year. Currently, it is one of the best and most successful singers of Brazil.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:2807393","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":5797516,"name":"Larissa Machado"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/2807393-Anitta","type":"artist","urls":["https://anitta.com.br","https://twitter.com/anitta","https://www.instagram.com/anitta","https://www.facebook.com/AnittaOficial","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anitta_(singer)"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/369690/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"369690","image":"","imageThumb":"","profile":"","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:369690","relations":{"aliases":null,"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":null},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/369690-G3","type":"artist","urls":["https://littlecorner.bandcamp.com/, https://soundcloud.com/g3p0, https://www.instagram.com/g3000000_/"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/48393/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"48393","image":"https://i.discogs.com/051Pb4smcgXkQONhXfxiksAUV2PsMbBH7vXALYmg4M4/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:338/w:526/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9B